      "summary": ": Today at CARDRONA ALPINE RESORT TODAY: 29 Aug 2026 – Cardrona is open today. However, the snowpack has dried out and a clear overnight freeze has left firm conditions across the mountain. The current temperature is -2°C with winds around 32 km/h and gusts to 56 km/h. Off-piste is particularly firm and variable, so the groomed runs are the better choice early. Kindy Conveyor, Learner Conveyors, McDougall’s Chondola, Whitestar Express, Valley View, Captains Express, T-Bar, Soho Express and Willow’s Quad are open, while Wells Pipe Platter is closed. Main Basin, Captains, Soho, Little Willows and Arcadia Chutes are open; Big Willows is on hold, while Mt Cardrona and Summit are delayed. Six of nine terrain parks are open, including Baby Bucks, Little Bucks, Antlers Alley, Stag Lane, Big Bucks and Gravity Cross. The road is now open after the midday traffic hold, but an active road hazard remains and the resort is operating with one car park available while the others are full. The Half Pipe closes at noon, and the resort is advising guests to take care after the overnight freeze and follow terrain signage.",
