      "summary": ": Today at TREBLE CONE TODAY: 29 Aug 2026 – Treble Cone will remain closed today. The resort's road contractors worked through the night to restore access for staff, allowing teams to begin preparing the mountain today. The current mountain temperature is -1°C, with winds around 26 km/h and gusts to 47 km/h. Home Basin Express, Saddle Quad and Beginner Platter are closed, and all listed grooming and terrain areas remain closed today. The access road is also closed to the public while contractors complete further work following the recent weather. The resort is working toward opening tomorrow, with substantial preparation still required both on and off the snow. The TC Snowboard Banked Slalom has been cancelled this weekend.",
